<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed index 6.4 November vs 5.3 Oct.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed index 6.4 November vs 5.3 Oct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia said on Thursday its diffusion index of business activity in the manufacturing sector rose to 6.4 in November from 5.3 in October.</p>
<p>				Nov   Drop   Unch   Rise    Oct</p>
<p>Business Conditions     6.4   16.4   60.7   22.8     5.3</p>
<p>New orders		  5.8   21.8   50.2   27.6     9.9</p>
<p>Shipments		  11.8   20.9   46.5   32.6    11.9</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 8.2   26.3   53.8   18.1   - 9.8</p>
<p>Delivery time	   -10.0   20.4   66.5   10.5   -13.7</p>
<p>Inventories	     -14.8   31.7   50.2   16.8   - 2.7</p>
<p>Prices paid		14.6    1.6   82.0   16.1    21.9</p>
<p>Prices received	   1.6    7.7   82.8    9.3     5.4</p>
<p>Number of employees     1.0   14.3   70.4   15.3   - 4.7</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660</p>
</text>
